OL,3,AAI could cause global economic
OL,4,Adownturn, Andrew Bailey warns G20
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe governor of the Bank of England has
OL,7,Fwarned G20 finance ministers that
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence could cause a
OL,9,Fglobal economic downturn and pose a
OL,10,Fsignificant cyber security risk to
OL,11,Ffinancial systems.
OL,13,FAndrew Bailey said any collapse of
OL,14,Fgrowth in the AI sector could lead to a
OL,15,F"future market correction" that spreads
OL,16,Fworldwide.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
