OL,3,AEx-gang boss guilty of orchestrating
OL,4,A1996 murder of rapper Tupac Shakur
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the trial, the court heard a
OL,7,Frecording of a police interview in 2008
OL,8,Fin which Davis said he was in the car
OL,9,Ffrom which shots were fired, but did
OL,10,Fnot himself fire the bullets that
OL,11,Fkilled Shakur.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
